  Activity, AlertCircle, ArrowDownLeft, ArrowUpLeft, BarChart3, Bell, Building2, CalendarDays,
  Check, ChevronDown, ChevronLeft, CircleDollarSign, ClipboardList, CreditCard, Download,
  FileText, Filter, Home, Landmark, LayoutDashboard, Loader2, LogOut, Menu, MoreHorizontal,
